  "reference": "Two 0.5 m layers of unit cross section with (k,C)=(1,1) and (4,2), separated by areal resistance 0.32. Add a spatially uniform temperature phasor to a homogeneous transfer solution and prescribe the corresponding layer generation, film ambients and wall storage. Compare four temperature traces, contact flux positive to the right and both inward wall fluxes. Check each end-wall energy balance and the contact drop."
